<title>UK: Queens Moat year pre-excepts profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Queens Moat year pre-excepts profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.2		    vs 13.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     15.0		   vs 42.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   449.8		  vs 454.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results include exceptional items. Excluding exceptionals, pretax profit was 4.6 million stg in 1996 versus a loss of 2.5 million stg in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it declared no dividends for the year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Queens Moat Houses Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
